---
// Ill11ReturnWaterfall.astro
// Visual brief: The Return Waterfall — From 18% Gross Return to Actual Investor IRR
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 11</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Return Waterfall: Gross vs Net IRR</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 rounded border border-amber-500/20 font-medium">Friction Cascade</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <!-- Gross Return -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Gross Portfolio Return</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">18.0%</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Leakages -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">2. Management Fees (Fixed 1.5–2%)</span>
        <span class="text-rose-500 font-mono">-2.0%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">3. Performance Fee / Carried Interest (15–20%)</span>
        <span class="text-rose-500 font-mono">-2.4%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">4. Custody, Audit & Operating Costs</span>
        <span class="text-rose-500 font-mono">-0.4%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/40 text-xs">
        <span class="font-semibold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300">5. Fund / Trust Level Tax Leakage (MMR / Business)</span>
        <span class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-mono font-bold">-2.2%</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">6. Liquidity Drag & Reinvestment Lag</span>
        <span class="text-rose-500 font-mono">-0.5%</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Net Result -->
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-navy-900 text-white dark:bg-navy-950 border border-slate-800">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold block text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Actual Investor Net IRR</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">What compounds in your family office account</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-mono font-bold text-white">10.5%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">The number printed on the fund presentation is not necessarily the number that compounds in your personal balance sheet.</p>
  </div>
</div>
